The [[Sources/Prompts/2026-10-22-nuwa-presentation-request.txt|latest presentation request]] asks for a separate Nuwa talk with the Paper2Agent considerations, similar length, value and inclusion. [[Designs/Nuwa Briefing/presentation/README]] delivers eight shown slides and two hidden backups, planned 5:50, with editable diagrams and notes. “numa” is interpreted as Nuwa from the preceding repository discussion. This changes the presentation deliverable, not the adopted architecture. The proposed integration follows the latest M2 factory context; it does not copy older M1 scope assumptions. No measured task benefit or integration is asserted.

